  "solution": {
    "text": "<p><mi><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/26106.PNG\" style=\"width: 200px; height: 110px;\" /></mi><br /><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>f</mi><mo>&#39;</mo></msup><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><msup><mfenced><mfrac><mn>3</mn><mn>5</mn></mfrac></mfenced><mi>x</mi></msup><mi>ln</mi><mfenced><mfrac><mn>3</mn><mn>5</mn></mfrac></mfenced><mo>+</mo><msup><mfenced><mfrac><mn>4</mn><mn>5</mn></mfrac></mfenced><mi>x</mi></msup><mi>ln</mi><mfenced><mfrac><mn>4</mn><mn>5</mn></mfrac></mfenced><mo>&#60;</mo><mn>0</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mo>&#8704;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced close=\"}\" open=\"{\"><mrow><mo>&#8757;</mo><mfrac><mi>d</mi><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfrac><msup><mi>a</mi><mi>x</mi></msup><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>a</mi><mi>x</mi></msup><mi>ln</mi><mi>a</mi></mrow></mfenced></math><br /><br />Hence, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced></math> is monotonically decreasing.<br /><br />Also,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><munder><mi>lim</mi><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo><mo>+</mo><mo>&#8734;</mo></mrow></munder><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>&#8594;</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></math>&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced close=\"}\" open=\"{\"><mrow><mo>&#8757;</mo><munder><mi>lim</mi><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo><mo>&#8734;</mo></mrow></munder><msup><mi>a</mi><mi>x</mi></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>&#60;</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>&#60;</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></math><br /><br />and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><munder><mi>lim</mi><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo><mo>-</mo><mo>&#8734;</mo></mrow></munder><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>&#8594;</mo><mo>&#8734;</mo></math>&nbsp; &nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced close=\"}\" open=\"{\"><mrow><mo>&#8757;</mo><munder><mi>lim</mi><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo><mo>-</mo><mo>&#8734;</mo></mrow></munder><msup><mi>a</mi><mi>x</mi></msup><mo>=</mo><mo>&#8734;</mo><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>&#60;</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>&#60;</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></math><br /><br />and there is only&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>1</mn></math>&nbsp;solution for&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math>.</p>",
